WEBVTT

00:14:25.094 --> 00:14:30.099
who showed up at polling places
in 2020 or at airports

00:14:30.133 --> 00:14:32.235
after the so-called Muslim ban,

00:14:32.235 --> 00:14:35.338
demanding respect for the rule of law.

00:14:35.371 --> 00:14:41.611
Black Lives Matter. Time's Up.
Black Girl Magic. Occupy Wall Street,

00:14:41.611 --> 00:14:44.013
Families Belong Together.

00:14:45.148 --> 00:14:48.050
At any given time on any given issue,

00:14:48.084 --> 00:14:50.386
they may make any one of us uncomfortable.

00:14:51.454 --> 00:14:54.457
But they have taken to the legislatures,
to the ballot boxes,

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:58.094
to the courtrooms
and peacefully to the streets

00:14:58.127 --> 00:15:00.763
to lay claim to their democracy,